# Build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
TestResults/
*.trx

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# OS
.DS_Store

# Secrets — the API key belongs in user-secrets or the environment, never in the tree.
# `.env.*` as well as `.env`: the variants (.env.local, .env.development) are the ones that get created in a
# hurry and are a rule away from being tracked.
.env
.env.*
*.local.json

# The developer bulk cache — whole *-bulk responses saved to disk so a mapper can be iterated on without
# re-downloading. The default directory from the README; tens of megabytes of vendor data, and never ours to
# redistribute. Entries are keyed by the request URL with the API key stripped, but the reason to ignore this
# is the payloads, not the names.
.fmp-bulk-cache/

# Agent scratch worktrees — checkouts of this same repo, never content to commit
.claude/worktrees/
